  Paider  dev-main

  USAGE:  <command> [options] [arguments]

  chat            Start an interactive Paider chat session in the current project.
  commit          Stage all changes and commit with an AI-generated message
  cost            Show token/spend usage per tier from the event log

  config:provider Set the active provider preset (tier stack)
  config:show     Show the active preset and the model resolved for each tier

